KG42.register("rules-4642347499ad5147c92f4919",{"id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R007","paper":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation","record":{"rule_id":"v141-c-R007","mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01","name":"Prosumer participation","process_stage":"participation","market_meaning":"Prosumers supplying surplus local generation may participate in energy sharing with neighbours within a microgrid or part of a distribution network. Scope: General P2P participation framework recorded under v141-a-M01; sharing within a microgrid or part of a distribution network.","independence_rationale":"Relations governed by the approved function participation.prosumer under the fixed relation-ownership template. Conditional branches retain their explicit scope in local constraints.","V":["participation.prosumer"],"E":[],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"participation","context_text":"General P2P participation framework recorded under v141-a-M01; sharing within a microgrid or part of a distribution network.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g01-e05"]},"x":[],"theta":[],"phi":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R007-C001","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"Prosumers supplying surplus local generation may participate in energy sharing with neighbours within a microgrid or part of a distribution network. Scope: General P2P participation framework recorded under v141-a-M01; sharing within a microgrid or part of a distribution network.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["participation.prosumer"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g01-e05"]},{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R007-C002","kind":"procedural","role":"supporting","statement":"Consumers are treated as a special type of prosumers who do not own any local generation; for convenience both prosumers and consumers are collectively referred to as prosumers, and the detailed market rules of the paradigm are collectively termed the 'P2P energy sharing mechanism'.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["participation.prosumer"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e04"]}],"pi":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-e02","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p04-c1r4__v141-a-M01-participation","page":4,"printed_page":"996","section":"3.1","anchor_text":"practice in many countries to set the export price in the FIT scheme co lower than the retail price.","equation_id":null,"figure_id":"Fig. 1","table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"condition"},"source_text":"However, in order to encourage prosumers to consume and balance distributed generation on site as much as possible, it is a common practice in many countries to set the export price in the FIT scheme lower than the retail price. This fact motivates the prosumers try sharing their surplus energy directly with their neighbours to seek higher revenues, which results in the so-called P2P energy sharing paradigm as shown in Fig. 1(b)."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-e05","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p04-c2r3__v141-a-M01-coordination","page":4,"printed_page":"996","section":"3.1","anchor_text":"gy sharing paradigm d P2P energy sharing paradigms. P2P energy sharing can be carried out among pros","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"P2P energy sharing can be carried out among prosumers in a microgrid or a part of distribution network (referred to as \"energy sharing region (ESR)\" in this paper), supervised by a market operator (named \"energy sharing coordinator\", short as \"coordinator\", in this paper). A coordinator is usually needed in P2P energy sharing practice due to two reasons. First of all, a coordinator is needed to specify the rules for trading and supervise the energy sharing activities. The rules include the core pricing model and implementation process, as well as other relevant rules to guarantee the interests of every participant. Secondly, a trading platform as well as the associated metering and billing mechanisms needs to be provided and operated by a coordinator, based on which P2P energy sharing is able to be conducted."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-e04","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p04-c1r4__v141-a-M01-participation","page":4,"printed_page":"996","section":"3.1","anchor_text":"practice in many countries to set the export price in the FIT scheme co lower than the retail price.","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"Note that consumers can be seen as a special type of prosumers who do not own any local generation. Therefore, for convenience, both prosumers and consumers are collectively referred as prosumers in the rest of the paper. Detailed market rules in the P2P energy sharing paradigm are collectively termed as \"P2P energy sharing mechanism\"."}],"field_notes":{"empty_E_reason":"C explicitly supplied only source-backed unary facts for this function; other graph gaps remain reviewable.","empty_x_reason":"No design-selection or operational decision variable is defined by the source for this participation rule. The evidence states participant eligibility and scope (prosumers sharing surplus local generation) rather than an optimization or operational decision variable.","empty_theta_reason":"No fixed input, constant, coefficient, bound, or numeric parameter is stated by the source for this participation rule. The supplied evidence v141-b-g01-e02, v141-b-g01-e04, and v141-b-g01-e05 is procedural/definitional text only."},"evidence_basis":"explicit","implementation_status":"unimplemented","status":"needs_review","lead_ids":["v141-a-M01-coordination","v141-a-M01-participation","v141-a-M04-participation"],"extras":{"decision_anchor":"participation.prosumer","graph_fact_supports":[[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-e05","quote":"P2P energy sharing can be carried out among prosumers in a microgrid or a part of distribution network"},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-e02","quote":"This fact motivates the prosumers try sharing their surplus energy directly with their neighbours to seek higher revenues"}]],"C2_formalization":{"graph_sha256":"c305474b26f753fc8bf8148e8b8bf8faa6800a8121a41719721db947209c0119","applicability":"non_mathematical","reason":"This rule is a participation/admission scope rule, not a mathematical market rule. The supplied B evidence states who may participate in P2P energy sharing and defines the prosumer domain, but it contains no equation, variable domain, parameter value, objective function, or formal constraint. The frozen graph contains only the unary node participation.prosumer and no edges, so no design-selection or operational decision variable and no fixed parameter are supported within this rule. Existing C.1 constraint C001 is preserved unchanged as not_formalized; an additional definitional/procedural constraint is added for the prosumer domain. B evidence remains unreviewed under the experimental policy.","bindings":[{"object_id":"v141-c-R007-C001","node_ids":["participation.prosumer"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"C001 is the core procedural participation/admission constraint for the prosumer role. It binds to the only frozen node participation.prosumer; the frozen rule has E = [], so no edge binding is available or claimed."},{"object_id":"v141-c-R007-C002","node_ids":["participation.prosumer"],"edge_ids":[],"rationale":"C002 defines the prosumer domain by stating that generation-less consumers are treated as prosumers for the P2P mechanism. It therefore binds to participation.prosumer, with no edge binding in the frozen empty-edge graph."}],"revision_requests":["B evidence v141-b-g01-e02, v141-b-g01-e04, and v141-b-g01-e05 remains unreviewed under the experimental policy; an independent B source audit is outstanding before scientific acceptance. No graph revision is requested because the frozen unary node participation.prosumer and empty E are sufficient for this procedural participation rule."]}},"quarantined_references":[]}});
